(Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how warehouse temperature mapping is carried out at Brookvale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all warehouse temperature mapping activities in production and quality control at Brookvale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Ana Lindqvist, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Inspect deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Confirm the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Clean the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Records) Tj T*
(Records of warehouse temperature mapping are kept for five years after batch expiry \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
